= Public Typst Playground

This public workspace keeps the preview and PDF export available without shipping
the private exam engine to the browser bundle.

== Quick Start

- Edit text directly in the center panel.
- Click the preview to jump back to matching source text.
- Use the PDF button only when you want a final export.

== Demo Math

$ f(x) = x^3 - 3x + 1 $

$ integral_0^1 x^2 dif x = 1 / 3 $

== Notes

You can also open the other public samples in the explorer:

- `bbt.typ` for a variation-table helper.
- `g-bank.typ` for question-bank utilities.